    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Are you ready for... The STEAM debut of the best game of 2025?*</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>*study only inclusive of games called 'Ultra-Ultra Doggy Trainer!!'</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u><i>______________________________________________</i></u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Ultra-Ultra Doggy Trainer!!</i> It's a special kind of RPG all about adopting your own puppy and training it to greatness!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>In a world where cats and dogs once fought a terrible war, the victory of the dogs is celebrated still to this day via seasonal championships. Every season, two contenders will battle for the right to challenge the champion the following season. You are ARLO KATMAN, a promising young trainer who has just adopted a new puppy.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>-Create your own puppy through the Design-a-Dog menu!</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>-Train your dog via a unique turn-based battle system.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>-Meet exciting rivals, and make quirky friends! Work a retail job, write a manifesto(???), or play games at the arcade.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>-Organise your day and navigate through a time passage system.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>-Explore Pastel Town and try to find all 12 Honey Sticks! </i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>-Conquer your opponents and become the CHAMPION OF PASTEL TOWN.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>FAQ</u></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Q: &quot;Will Jamie Jameson be my prom date?&quot;</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>A: He will, but only to get a free dinner out of you.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Q: &quot;What is the unemployment rate of Pastel Town?&quot;</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>A: 31.818%</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Q: &quot;What should I do if I get trapped in a corner while playing?&quot;</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>A: Press shift to open the menu, close it again, and move in the desired direction while the menu is closing.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Q: &quot;Mac/Linux support?&quot;</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>A: Uhhhhh... Quick! Look! A flying dog! *runs away*</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Are you ready for... The STEAM debut of the best game of 2025?*</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>*study only inclusive of games called 'Ultra-Ultra Doggy Trainer!!'</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u><i>______________________________________________</i></u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Ultra-Ultra Doggy Trainer!!</i> It's a special kind of RPG all about adopting your own puppy and training it to greatness!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>In a world where cats and dogs once fought a terrible war, the victory of the dogs is celebrated still to this day via seasonal championships. Every season, two contenders will battle for the right to challenge the champion the following season. You are ARLO KATMAN, a promising young trainer who has just adopted a new puppy.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>-Create your own puppy through the Design-a-Dog menu!</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>-Train your dog via a unique turn-based battle system.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>-Meet exciting rivals, and make quirky friends! Work a retail job, write a manifesto(???), or play games at the arcade.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>-Organise your day and navigate through a time passage system.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>-Explore Pastel Town and try to find all 12 Honey Sticks! </i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>-Conquer your opponents and become the CHAMPION OF PASTEL TOWN.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>FAQ</u></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Q: &quot;Will Jamie Jameson be my prom date?&quot;</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>A: He will, but only to get a free dinner out of you.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Q: &quot;What is the unemployment rate of Pastel Town?&quot;</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>A: 31.818%</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Q: &quot;What should I do if I get trapped in a corner while playing?&quot;</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>A: Press shift to open the menu, close it again, and move in the desired direction while the menu is closing.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Q: &quot;Mac/Linux support?&quot;</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>A: Uhhhhh... Quick! Look! A flying dog! *runs away*</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
